Of course, a full treatment of Libgit2's capabilities is outside the scope of this book. If you want more information on Libgit2 itself, there's API documentation at https://libgit2.github.com/libgit2[^], and a set of guides at https://libgit2.github.com/docs[^]. For the other bindings, check the bundled README and tests; there are often small tutorials and pointers to further reading there.oolean